  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000rkfp](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000rkfp) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 170.96 depth occurred on Dec 23 2025 61km SW of Gaua Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.7032 longitude 167.1651. It impacted 2852 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
